    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppet: Hide And Seek</strong> - is a 7 vs 1 multiplayer horror game where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape from the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide And Seek</strong> - is a multiplayer horror game in (7 vs 1) mode, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer, and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU BE SAVED??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-user features</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of our in-game positional voice chat. Invite friends or find other players using the server browser. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in closets, walls, bushes, houses, but remember the main thing is your life is at stake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up or hide alone to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the allotted time and sail away into the sunset from this cursed island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play like everyone else or start <i><u>stand out</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can choose a character to your taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal of the Survivors in each game is to try not to get caught by the Killer and escape from the scene of the murders - it sounds easier than it really is.</strong></p>",
